<h1><span>♞</span> Rules</h1>

<p>The screen displays only a chess board and a list of moves in the form of <a href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Algebraic_notation_(chess)#Notation_for_moves" target="_blank">SAN notation</a>.</p>
<p>When you click on a move, you can see the updated board and the SAN notation of the moves your opponent will have to choose from. Note that the chess, draw, mate and promotion information is not displayed. You need to be able to preview the move mentally to see the final outcome!</p>
<p>Once you made your choice, simply click on the big green button to validate your move.</p>
<p><strong>Good luck!</strong></p>
